1
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,360
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:27,760
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,640
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:35,360
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:39,040
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:42,720
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:48,400
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:55,720
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:58,560
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,560 --> 00:00:59,480
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:04,120
=Episode 1=

12
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:16,159
(I must've been watching too many
costume dramas lately.)

13
00:01:16,159 --> 00:01:19,320
(I actually dreamed of such a handsome
ancient man in my bed.)

14
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:21,719
Feng Weiyue,

15
00:01:21,719 --> 00:01:23,119
you've grown bold.

16
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:25,840
(How... How does he know my name?)

17
00:01:27,639 --> 00:01:28,920
(This isn't a dream?)

18
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:32,119
(Could it be)

19
00:01:33,199 --> 00:01:34,400
(I've transmigrated?)

20
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:40,480
(Mo Yuya)

21
00:01:42,519 --> 00:01:43,400
It hurts.

22
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,840
It really hurts.

23
00:01:47,039 --> 00:01:49,840
I suppose you're tired of the position
of princess consort

24
00:01:50,119 --> 00:01:51,519
and wish to die.

25
00:01:57,159 --> 00:01:58,519
Pei Chen.

26
00:01:58,519 --> 00:01:59,159
Your Highness.

27
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,760
(Pei Chen)
Why is the princess consort here too?

28
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,360
You ask me why she's here?

29
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,639
How come you failed to guard my door?

30
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,360
(Sands of Peace)
Take her away.

31
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:17,559
(There was a thunderstorm
when I was doing my experiment.)

32
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:19,239
(According to the law,)

33
00:02:19,239 --> 00:02:20,800
(if I die here,)

34
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,880
(does it mean I can go back?)

35
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,119
Buddy.

36
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:28,280
Lend me this.

37
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:30,239
Hold this.

38
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:31,480
Don't move.

39
00:02:45,039 --> 00:02:45,920
Goodbye.

40
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:18,239
(Why am I still in this godforsaken
place?)

41
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,320
Miss, you're awake.

42
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:27,119
Let me introduce myself.

43
00:03:27,639 --> 00:03:32,119
I'm an administrator
from the Time and Space Bureau.

44
00:03:34,239 --> 00:03:36,239
Time and Space Bureau administrator?

45
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:40,239
Actually, when you were testing
spatial products,

46
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:42,159
we accidentally moved
the magnetic field's path,

47
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:43,719
causing a space-time torsion.

48
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:48,119
That's how you came here
from the 21st century.

49
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:54,519
So that white light from our experiment

50
00:03:55,199 --> 00:03:56,639
was caused by you.

51
00:04:01,159 --> 00:04:02,000
Well, you shouldn't have

52
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:04,280
researched something
that shouldn't belong to you.

53
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,880
But as for you,

54
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:09,119
this is a blessing in disguise.

55
00:04:13,119 --> 00:04:15,000
How did this bracelet come here too?

56
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:17,360
Listen to me.

57
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:18,639
Here's what happened.

58
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:20,679
To show my apology,

59
00:04:20,679 --> 00:04:24,280
I'll give you 100 commodity points.

60
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,280
One hundred commodity points?

61
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:30,119
(100 points received)

62
00:04:30,119 --> 00:04:31,320
With this,

63
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:35,000
you'll have a cheat in ancient times,
right?

64
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:39,119
(A cheat?)

65
00:04:40,260 --> 00:04:44,600
(Prince Rong's Mansion)

66
00:04:45,199 --> 00:04:46,239
Is she awake?

67
00:04:46,519 --> 00:04:47,639
She is.

68
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:48,960
The doctor is examining her.

69
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,620
(Letter)

70
00:04:51,679 --> 00:04:52,800
(Qian Ning)
Your Highness,

71
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,000
you've finally made up your mind?

72
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:55,960
It's been three years.

73
00:04:56,039 --> 00:04:58,199
She's challenged your limits
again and again.

74
00:04:58,559 --> 00:05:01,280
And now she's done something
this insane.

75
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,239
Your place truly can't
keep her any longer.

76
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:07,000
Even if Grand Tutor Feng's
teachings to me were great,

77
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:10,679
they're only enough to spare her life.

78
00:05:11,559 --> 00:05:12,599
After all,

79
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:16,760
she did that to Feng Qingyun
three years ago.

80
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:18,320
(Three years ago)

81
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:20,280
Weiyue, please spare me.

82
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,559
I don't want to marry Yuya anymore.

83
00:05:25,599 --> 00:05:26,639
Yuya?

84
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:28,679
Weiyue,

85
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:30,480
I won't compete with you
for the marriage alliance

86
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,159
between our family
and Prince Rong's Mansion anymore.

87
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:33,440
Please spare me.

88
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:36,079
I didn't do anything.

89
00:05:36,559 --> 00:05:38,239
(Consort Dowager Mei)
Feng Weiyue is so vicious.

90
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:39,960
How could she deserve to be
my princess consort?

91
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:40,440
You...

92
00:05:42,239 --> 00:05:45,239
Feng Qingyun looks innocent and harmless
on the surface,

93
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:48,360
but her eyes aren't so innocent.

94
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,679
Trust me.

95
00:05:49,679 --> 00:05:52,440
Feng Weiyue, the legitimate daughter of
the Feng family, is your true match.

96
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,800
It's settled.

97
00:05:55,119 --> 00:05:56,119
You will marry

98
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:57,320
Feng Weiyue.

99
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:01,920
(Divorce Letter)

100
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:04,060
Three years ago,
you fell in love

101
00:06:04,060 --> 00:06:05,920
(Chunya Teahouse)
with the Prince of Rong, Mo Yuya.

102
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:08,360
It was love at first sight.

103
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,639
You pursued him relentlessly.

104
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,960
Later, to steal him from the wedding,

105
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:14,119
you broke your half-sister's leg.

106
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:17,280
And now your sister has completely
turned to the dark side.

107
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:20,719
She's even bribed the famous assassin
organization in the martial world,

108
00:06:21,039 --> 00:06:23,559
Xingzhao Pavilion, to take your head.

109
00:06:23,559 --> 00:06:25,039
Take my sister's life.

110
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:26,719
Get the job done.

111
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:28,800
Don't disappoint me.

112
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:29,840
Rest assured.

113
00:06:30,239 --> 00:06:31,599
(Assassin of Xingzhao Pavilion)
Once Xingzhao Pavilion strikes,

114
00:06:31,639 --> 00:06:33,079
no one survives.

115
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:34,800
Ugh!

116
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:37,000
What kind of disastrous start is this?

117
00:06:38,679 --> 00:06:39,320
Alright now.

118
00:06:39,639 --> 00:06:41,039
On behalf of the Time and Space Bureau,

119
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:45,239
I hope you can survive until the next
day of the three-star alignment.

120
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:46,960
Bye.

121
00:06:48,239 --> 00:06:49,800
Hey, wait! Don't go yet!

122
00:06:52,039 --> 00:06:53,280
Friendly reminder:

123
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:55,480
there are 452.7 days left

124
00:06:55,639 --> 00:06:57,800
until the next day
of the three-star alignment.

125
00:06:58,639 --> 00:07:00,639
The day of the three-star alignment?

126
00:07:02,719 --> 00:07:03,599
My head!

127
00:07:04,119 --> 00:07:05,800
(Divorce Letter)
Send this to her.

128
00:07:06,039 --> 00:07:07,440
Understood.

129
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:10,639
Why so flustered?

130
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:11,800
What is it?

131
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:13,360
Your Highness,

132
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:15,360
Feng Weiyue has already left the manor.

133
00:07:15,679 --> 00:07:17,440
And she sent someone to deliver this.

134
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,040
(Divorce Letter)

135
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:25,039
Just terrific.

136
00:07:25,199 --> 00:07:27,119
I haven't even discarded her yet,

137
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:30,440
and she actually had the nerve
to divorce me first

138
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:33,159
She must've finally known her place.

139
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:35,639
At least her move suits your wishes.

140
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:38,079
So the divorce is settled, isn't it?

141
00:07:38,559 --> 00:07:40,119
You want to divorce Weiyue?

142
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:41,400
I don't allow it.

143
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:44,840
Mother.

144
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:47,159
Weiyue is the daughter-in-law
I've chosen.

145
00:07:47,239 --> 00:07:48,760
You can't divorce so easily.

146
00:07:49,119 --> 00:07:50,280
You have three days.

147
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,800
Go talk her into coming back.

148
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:53,639
Otherwise...

149
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:02,800
My lady,

150
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:03,840
your wound hasn't healed.

151
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:05,480
Why are you rushing back
to your parents' home?

152
00:08:06,159 --> 00:08:07,519
If I don't leave now, I'll die.

153
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:17,520
Feng Weiyue!

154
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:19,239
(No way.)

155
00:08:19,439 --> 00:08:21,079
(Assassin)
Xingzhao Pavilion never rests?

156
00:08:21,079 --> 00:08:21,960
(They're here already?)

157
00:08:22,159 --> 00:08:22,720
Go back.

158
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,479
(Good thing the dimensional bracelet
came with me.)

159
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,960
(Give me some weapons.)

160
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:28,920
(A pistol or a bomb.)

161
00:08:29,239 --> 00:08:30,880
(Only enough points left for a pan)
Even a self-defense gadget would do.

162
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,960
That's enough, Mother.

163
00:08:33,479 --> 00:08:34,520
I'll go.

164
00:08:35,279 --> 00:08:36,439
But you should know

165
00:08:36,800 --> 00:08:38,319
that you can protect her once,

166
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,439
but not the next time.

167
00:08:42,319 --> 00:08:43,880
No point in talking about the next time.

168
00:08:44,279 --> 00:08:45,840
Go bring Weiyue back to me at once.

169
00:08:48,279 --> 00:08:49,000
Let's go.

170
00:08:50,319 --> 00:08:51,079
What's this?

171
00:08:51,079 --> 00:08:52,199
Stop wasting time. Get her!

172
00:09:16,399 --> 00:09:17,119
Stop!

173
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,520
Stop running!

174
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:20,800
Thank you...

175
00:09:23,159 --> 00:09:24,079
What's wrong?

176
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:26,199
Am I more terrifying
than the King of Hell?

177
00:09:27,479 --> 00:09:29,000
Why are you here?

178
00:09:29,319 --> 00:09:32,479
Your Highness, are you dissatisfied
with the divorce letter?

179
00:09:33,119 --> 00:09:34,479
How dare you even mention it?

180
00:09:35,199 --> 00:09:36,199
Feng Weiyue,

181
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:39,039
what trick are you playing now?

182
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:41,880
Retreating to advance?

183
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:48,760
(Oh no.)

184
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:50,279
(My sinister sister is here.)

185
00:09:51,199 --> 00:09:52,079
Your Highness,

186
00:09:52,079 --> 00:09:53,600
since we're already divorced,

187
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,319
we should keep our distance.

188
00:09:57,279 --> 00:09:58,199
Off you go.

189
00:10:03,239 --> 00:10:04,119
Yuya.

190
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,600
Feng Weiyue, what makes you

191
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:10,560
so unbelievably strong?

192
00:10:12,199 --> 00:10:13,079
Qingyun,

193
00:10:13,079 --> 00:10:14,960
His Highness and I are already divorced.

194
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,560
Let him take you back now.

195
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:23,239
What...

196
00:10:23,239 --> 00:10:25,039
I wish you both well

197
00:10:25,159 --> 00:10:26,079
and every happiness.

198
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:27,319
Bye.

199
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:28,279
I'm leaving.

200
00:10:29,319 --> 00:10:30,439
I'm talking to you...

201
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:35,119
Yuya,

202
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:36,640
Weiyue just said...

203
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:37,680
Don't mind her.

204
00:10:38,479 --> 00:10:39,319
She's lost her mind.

205
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:40,960
She's just raving.

206
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:46,960
(Grand Tutor's Residence)
Grand Tutor's Residence?

207
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:49,600
(Is this my home in this world?)

208
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:11,920
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

209
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:14,440
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

210
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:18,480
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

211
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:21,280
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

212
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:25,280
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

213
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:28,080
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

214
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:33,680
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

215
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,960
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

216
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:42,280
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

217
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:46,080
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

218
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,640
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

219
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:52,800
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

220
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:55,520
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

221
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,440
♪This love remains unchanged♪

222
00:11:57,440 --> 00:12:00,960
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

223
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:05,120
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

224
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:09,240
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

225
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:12,000
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

226
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:14,000
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

227
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,639
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

228
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:19,000
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

229
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:23,320
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

230
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:25,680
♪I don't regret that vow♪

231
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:29,160
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
